{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261127/photo/bkn-20261127182046514-1127_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261127182529\"/><p>康文署SmartPLAY康體通發生資料外洩。</p><p>康文署SmartPLAY康體通發生資料外洩！個人資料私隱專員公署今日(27日)表示，接獲相關通報，初步資料顯示，約9萬名人士的個人資料可能受影響。</p><p>受影響人士的個人資料，可能包括姓名、性別、出生日期、地址、電郵地址及電話號碼。署方已根據既定機制展開調查，並提醒相關機構盡快通知受影響人士。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:03:52.614926+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T10:20:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T11:37:15.230681+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T10:57:15.785473+00:00","content_hash":"839ad55d662dab72c8addea221f64a4e3402d2381f25390e7bdd288297ac8aeb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}